1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,424
As a child, Hanuman flew toward the sun, mistaking it for fruit.

2
00:00:06,324 --> 00:00:08,196
Indra struck him down.

3
00:00:09,296 --> 00:00:11,744
The gods feared what he might become.

4
00:00:12,744 --> 00:00:16,224
So they sealed his strength behind a curse of forgetting.

5
00:00:17,024 --> 00:00:19,520
Until someone reminded him who he was.

6
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:23,000
Your weakness may not be a flaw.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,552
It may be protection—waiting for the hour you are ready.

